# Throwaway build context filter for local image builds.
# The repo root is ~1GB, almost all of it extracted OFED trees that the
# image build does not need. Use with: podman build --ignorefile poc/dks/dockerignore
*

# Consumed by the go_builder and base stages
!entrypoint
# go_builder runs `make build`, which only needs the sources: bin/ is lint-only
# tooling (golangci-lint, go-licenses) and build/ is a stale host-arch binary that
# gets overwritten anyway. Together they are ~74MB of the 84MB tree.
entrypoint/bin
entrypoint/build
entrypoint/cover.out
!entrypoint.sh
!loader.sh
!stig-fixer.sh

# RHEL_Dockerfile adds this to both driver-src and precompiled; without it the
# RHEL build fails at ADD while the Ubuntu build does not care.
!dtk_nic_driver_build.sh

# Only needed when D_OFED_URL_PATH points at a local tarball instead of a URL.
# The deb and rpm builds take different archives: -debian for Ubuntu, plain for RHEL.
!ofed
ofed/*
!ofed/MLNX_OFED_SRC-debian-26.07-0.7.7.0.tgz
!ofed/MLNX_OFED_SRC-26.07-0.7.7.0.tgz
